		(property "Value" "Misc analog input 1 (panel BNC, /1//2 selectable) -- /1//2 shunt header, BOTH legs (fix round 2): row 1 (pins 1-3) = SIGNAL leg, row 2 (pins 4-6) = SHIELD leg. Populate with ONE 2-GANG SHORTING BLOCK spanning both rows at the SAME column position -- pins 1-2 + 4-5 for x1 (direct), pins 2-3 + 5-6 for x2 (divider tap) -- NEVER two independent 1-gang shunts: that is the exact defect this header replaces (fix round 1 left it physically possible for the two legs' own jumpers to disagree; a mechanically-ganged 2-gang block makes disagreement physically impossible instead of merely documented against)."
			(at 82.042 331.47 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
